{"id":"8e85465156bba9c312fed44ef6ec585bacda718d","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1234661","title":"自从 Gemini3.7 发布后，我 Antigravity 就连不上了～","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"bbxx11","excerpt":"Google - @bbxx11 - antigravity 桌面端、cli 里面 Gemini 的模型就连不上了，但是 claude 的模型还可以用～网页版和 app 可以用！ 换节点也不起作用有遇到的朋友吗","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>antigravity 桌面端、cli 里面 Gemini 的模型就连不上了，但是 claude 的模型还可以用～</p>\n<p>网页版和 app 可以用！ </p>\n<p>换节点也不起作用\n有遇到的朋友吗</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17977917\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d3a1/ff18/92937_normal.png?m=1718195086\" alt=\"GlobalNPC\" data-uid=\"92937\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/GlobalNPC\">GlobalNPC</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-15 20:40:58 +08:00\">23h 25m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>风控变严了，普遍的送中</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17977929\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/14faff2d98f54e32e321b3aaf75d41c0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nguoidiqua\" data-uid=\"410234\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nguoidiqua\">nguoidiqua</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-15 20:52:37 +08:00\">23h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>换个干净点的节点，它更新 IP 库了，很多节点被当作中国 IP 了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17977948\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a1e52c227c2c0e046fb2525b593f7085?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"vkillwucy\" data-uid=\"279230\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/vkillwucy\">vkillwucy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-15 21:10:40 +08:00\">22h 55m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是的，我切了个韩国节点才可以</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17978089\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7f82ea103de35fe33a2e0c2be334fd44?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"luckycat\" data-uid=\"136935\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/luckycat\">luckycat</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-15 22:41:16 +08:00\">21h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>只要用的是中国速度还可以的机房 IP ，迟早都会被送中。因为你的邻居们都会开着 GPS 翻墙，然后就会被 Google 定位为此 IP 段实际在中国使用，从而把该段全部定位为中国，简称送中。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17978141\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8d30/223e/276391_normal.png?m=1550139201\" alt=\"freak118\" data-uid=\"276391\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/freak118\">freak118</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-15 23:23:13 +08:00\">20h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>一样 我也被送中了 这种是不是已经被标记了啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17978287\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a3c7/88c5/7498_normal.png?m=1335020271\" alt=\"limon\" data-uid=\"7498\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/limon\">limon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-16 02:04:04 +08:00\">18h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我是  cliproxy 反代出来可以</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17978323\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ca8de5ce310c84ec0abf08eb3f12b068?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Tory12138\" data-uid=\"818002\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Tory12138\">Tory12138</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-16 05:45:39 +08:00\">14h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>应该是严了，我之前在国内把所有的节点都测试了一遍 antigravity 都用不了，这次出国之后就可以用了，我都一直以为 antigravity 是个半成品，之前在国内问问题直接转圈圈，不回复也不报错</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17978340\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9189712729ab0b90273e6189e255186b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Vanson\" data-uid=\"40020\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Vanson\">Vanson</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-16 07:47:36 +08:00\">12h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n      